windvale-assembly 1

# Windows x64 staged-WVO publisher. Portable Windvale code admits the exact
# input/manifest/chunk sequence; this adapter independently validates and
# rereads those immutable snapshots, rejects destination aliases, and owns the
# exclusive-sibling handle-relative durable replacement transaction.
